# The radix and the digits of d_ecode are one number type (B18, T5).
# Number literals take either type, but an Int variable is an Int: an
# Int radix with Float digits is a type error, not a conversion (f_loat
# converts).
== SOURCE
n := 2
n d_ecode 1.5 2.5
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected Int, found Float at 7..24
